{"content_hash": "94f80c26980b6052", "version_id": 352, "article_id": 36, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "British Runner Hunter Bell Celebrates Team's Success", "title_zh": "英国跑者亨特·贝尔为女队成功喝彩", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "skysports", "source_url": "https://www.skysports.com/athletics/news/12040/13596451/georgia-hunter-bell-british-800m-and-1500m-runner-celebrates-teams-female-track-success", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1656111734352-beba25e0f603?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8aHVudGVyJTIwc3BvcnRzJTIwYWN0aW9ufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE1NTMzNDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Aaron James on Unsplash", "author": "Aaron James", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@aaronjamesmedia_co?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-man-in-a-hat-holding-a-gun-UiUudRJblm4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(346, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(24, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "35624543b66c"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 278, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Georgia Hunter Bell is a British runner. She won three gold medals this year. She says her team's success helps her run faster.", "lead_zh": "乔治亚·亨特·贝尔是英国跑者。今年她拿下三枚金牌。她说队友的成功让她跑得更快。", "preview": "Georgia Hunter Bell had a great year. She won three gold medals in 2025. She won at the World Indoor Championships, the Commonwealth Games, ", "preview_zh": "乔治亚·亨特·贝尔这一年过得很好。2025年她赢得三枚金牌。她在世界室内锦标赛、英联邦运动会和欧洲锦标赛上都拿了金牌。其他英国女选手也表现很棒。短跑选手艾米·亨特在伯明翰的欧锦赛上拿下四枚金牌。迪娜·阿舍-史密斯现在在欧锦赛上共有11枚奖牌，其中八枚是金牌。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 342, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/36/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 105.138, "size_bytes": 634608, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 326, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@c0318d5/content/data/versions/352.json", "paragraphs": ["Georgia Hunter Bell had a great year. She won three gold medals in 2025. She won at the World Indoor Championships, the Commonwealth Games, and the European Championships. Other British women also did very well. Sprinter Amy Hunt won four gold medals at the Europeans in Birmingham. Dina Asher-Smith now has 11 medals at the championships. Eight of them are gold.", "Keely Hodgkinson won World Indoor gold in the 800m in March. It was the second-fastest indoor time in history. She also set a new British record in the summer. But she did not win gold at the Europeans. She also missed the Commonwealth Games because of muscle tightness.", "Hunter Bell says she loves being part of this team. \"We all know each other very well,\" she told Sky Sports. \"We travel together and see each other a lot.\" She says when a teammate wins a medal, she wants to do well too. \"It makes you even more keen to do well,\" she said.", "The British women also care about their look. Amy Hunt is famous for her nail art. Her nails showed places in Birmingham, like the Bull Ring. \"Everyone knows I love a bit of glam and I love my nails,\" Hunt told the BBC. Hunter Bell says feeling good on the start line gives \"that extra one or two per cent\".", "Keely Hodgkinson wore a new full-length hooded speed suit at a race in London last month. People said it looked like Cathy Freeman's suit from the 2000 Sydney Olympics. Hunter Bell did not say no to wearing it one day. \"They do say it's quicker, so I'm definitely not ruling it out,\" she said."], "paragraphs_zh": ["乔治亚·亨特·贝尔这一年过得很好。2025年她赢得三枚金牌。她在世界室内锦标赛、英联邦运动会和欧洲锦标赛上都拿了金牌。其他英国女选手也表现很棒。短跑选手艾米·亨特在伯明翰的欧锦赛上拿下四枚金牌。迪娜·阿舍-史密斯现在在欧锦赛上共有11枚奖牌，其中八枚是金牌。", "基莉·霍奇金森在三月赢得世界室内800米金牌。这是历史上第二快的室内成绩。她还在夏天创造了新的英国纪录。但她在欧锦赛上没有拿到金牌。她还因为肌肉紧张错过了英联邦运动会。", "亨特·贝尔说她很喜欢成为这个团队的一员。她告诉天空体育：“我们彼此非常了解。我们一起旅行，经常见面。”她说当队友赢得奖牌时，她也想跑得好。“这让你更想跑出好成绩，”她说。", "英国女选手也很在意自己的形象。艾米·亨特以她的美甲出名。她的指甲上画着伯明翰的地标，比如斗牛场购物中心。亨特告诉BBC：“大家都知道我喜欢一点魅力，我爱我的指甲。”亨特·贝尔说，在起跑线上感觉良好能带来“那一两个百分点的额外动力”。", "上个月在伦敦的一场比赛中，基莉·霍奇金森穿了一件新的连帽全长速度服。人们说它看起来像凯茜·弗里曼在2000年悉尼奥运会上的服装。亨特·贝尔没有排除自己有一天也穿它的可能。她说：“他们说它更快，所以我绝对不排除这个可能。”"], "body": "Georgia Hunter Bell had a great year. She won three gold medals in 2025. She won at the World Indoor Championships, the Commonwealth Games, and the European Championships. Other British women also did very well. Sprinter Amy Hunt won four gold medals at the Europeans in Birmingham. Dina Asher-Smith now has 11 medals at the championships. Eight of them are gold.\n\nKeely Hodgkinson won World Indoor gold in the 800m in March. It was the second-fastest indoor time in history. She also set a new British record in the summer. But she did not win gold at the Europeans. She also missed the Commonwealth Games because of muscle tightness.\n\nHunter Bell says she loves being part of this team. \"We all know each other very well,\" she told Sky Sports. \"We travel together and see each other a lot.\" She says when a teammate wins a medal, she wants to do well too. \"It makes you even more keen to do well,\" she said.\n\nThe British women also care about their look. Amy Hunt is famous for her nail art. Her nails showed places in Birmingham, like the Bull Ring. \"Everyone knows I love a bit of glam and I love my nails,\" Hunt told the BBC. Hunter Bell says feeling good on the start line gives \"that extra one or two per cent\".\n\nKeely Hodgkinson wore a new full-length hooded speed suit at a race in London last month. People said it looked like Cathy Freeman's suit from the 2000 Sydney Olympics. Hunter Bell did not say no to wearing it one day. \"They do say it's quicker, so I'm definitely not ruling it out,\" she said.", "body_zh": "乔治亚·亨特·贝尔这一年过得很好。2025年她赢得三枚金牌。她在世界室内锦标赛、英联邦运动会和欧洲锦标赛上都拿了金牌。其他英国女选手也表现很棒。短跑选手艾米·亨特在伯明翰的欧锦赛上拿下四枚金牌。迪娜·阿舍-史密斯现在在欧锦赛上共有11枚奖牌，其中八枚是金牌。\n\n基莉·霍奇金森在三月赢得世界室内800米金牌。这是历史上第二快的室内成绩。她还在夏天创造了新的英国纪录。但她在欧锦赛上没有拿到金牌。她还因为肌肉紧张错过了英联邦运动会。\n\n亨特·贝尔说她很喜欢成为这个团队的一员。她告诉天空体育：“我们彼此非常了解。我们一起旅行，经常见面。”她说当队友赢得奖牌时，她也想跑得好。“这让你更想跑出好成绩，”她说。\n\n英国女选手也很在意自己的形象。艾米·亨特以她的美甲出名。她的指甲上画着伯明翰的地标，比如斗牛场购物中心。亨特告诉BBC：“大家都知道我喜欢一点魅力，我爱我的指甲。”亨特·贝尔说，在起跑线上感觉良好能带来“那一两个百分点的额外动力”。\n\n上个月在伦敦的一场比赛中，基莉·霍奇金森穿了一件新的连帽全长速度服。人们说它看起来像凯茜·弗里曼在2000年悉尼奥运会上的服装。亨特·贝尔没有排除自己有一天也穿它的可能。她说：“他们说它更快，所以我绝对不排除这个可能。”", "text": "Georgia Hunter Bell had a great year. She won three gold medals in 2025. She won at the World Indoor Championships, the Commonwealth Games, and the European Championships. Other British women also did very well. Sprinter Amy Hunt won four gold medals at the Europeans in Birmingham. Dina Asher-Smith now has 11 medals at the championships. Eight of them are gold. Keely Hodgkinson won World Indoor gold in the 800m in March. It was the second-fastest indoor time in history. She also set a new British record in the summer. But she did not win gold at the Europeans. She also missed the Commonwealth Games because of muscle tightness. Hunter Bell says she loves being part of this team. \"We all know each other very well,\" she told Sky Sports. \"We travel together and see each other a lot.\" She says when a teammate wins a medal, she wants to do well too. \"It makes you even more keen to do well,\" she said. The British women also care about their look. Amy Hunt is famous for her nail art. Her nails showed places in Birmingham, like the Bull Ring. \"Everyone knows I love a bit of glam and I love my nails,\" Hunt told the BBC. Hunter Bell says feeling good on the start line gives \"that extra one or two per cent\". Keely Hodgkinson wore a new full-length hooded speed suit at a race in London last month. People said it looked like Cathy Freeman's suit from the 2000 Sydney Olympics. Hunter Bell did not say no to wearing it one day. \"They do say it's quicker, so I'm definitely not ruling it out,\" she said.", "vocab": [{"word": "medal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖牌", "note": "常与 win 搭配：win a medal"}, {"word": "gold", "pos": "noun", "zh": "金牌", "note": "gold medal 的简称"}, {"word": "runner", "pos": "noun", "zh": "跑者", "note": "动词 run 加 -er 变成人"}, {"word": "team", "pos": "noun", "zh": "团队", "note": "常用词，如 Team GB 英国队"}, {"word": "record", "pos": "noun", "zh": "纪录", "note": "set a record 创造纪录"}, {"word": "championship", "pos": "noun", "zh": "锦标赛", "note": "常以复数出现：championships"}, {"word": "success", "pos": "noun", "zh": "成功", "note": "形容词是 successful"}, {"word": "glam", "pos": "noun", "zh": "魅力、华丽", "note": "口语词，来自 glamour"}], "title_original": "Hunter Bell celebrates in Team GB's 'glam' female track success", "summary_original": "Georgia Hunter Bell has enjoyed quite the year, winning a hat-trick of gold medals at the World Indoor Championships, for England at the Commonwealth Games, and again for Team GB at the European Championships.", "body_original": "Exclusive\nGeorgia Hunter Bell: British 800m and 1500m runner celebrates team's female track success\nGeorgia Hunter Bell, Keely Hodgkinson, Amy Hunt and Dina Asher-Smith are standout members of a strong British female core delivering medals on the track; Hunter Bell: \"We're locked into everyone's goals... someone winning or bringing home a medal, it makes you even more keen to do well\"\nThursday 8 October 2026 17:10, UK\nGeorgia Hunter Bell has enjoyed quite the year, winning a hat-trick of gold medals at the World Indoor Championships, for England at the Commonwealth Games, and again for Team GB at the European Championships.\nBut British female track success in 2025 certainly didn't stop there. Sprinter Amy Hunt made headlines with a record four-gold display in the Europeans in Birmingham, while Dina Asher-Smith now tops the all-time medal table at the championships after winning her 11th, eight of which are gold.\nAmong other successes, Keely Hodgkinson claimed World Indoor gold in the 800m in March - in the second-fastest indoor time in history - and set a new British record at that distance in the summer, though she'd be pipped to gold at the Europeans after sitting out the Commonwealth Games due to muscle tightness.\nPlease use Chrome browser for a more accessible video player\nSky Sports on WhatsApp: Breaking news, videos and analysis\nDownload the Sky Sports app for expert analysis, best video & more\nLatest Sky Sports deals\nor\nstream with no contract on NOW\n\"It's really cool. just being part of this era. It's really fun,\" Hunter Bell told\nSky Sports\n.\n\"We all know each other very well. We all travel together, see each other a lot throughout the year, so it's fun to tune in and be like, 'Oh, Amy's racing tonight'.\n\"We're locked into everyone's goals and what they're trying to do. And when you're on a team together, someone winning or bringing home a medal, it makes you even more keen to do well because you want to contribute.\"\nPlease use Chrome browser for a more accessible video player\nIn addition to her statement performances on the track during her record-breaking Europeans, Hunt earned attention for her curated nail art that gave nod to landmarks within Birmingham, like the Bull Ring.\n\"Everyone knows I love a bit of glam and I love my nails,\" Hunt told the\nBBC\nat the time.\nHunter Bell says it's something the GB squad share, as feeling your best self on the start line can provide \"that extra one or two per cent\" to make you \"feel like you can do anything\".\n\"I enjoy the whole process of getting ready. We get ready like we're going to a club, we're quite glammed up,\" Hunter Bell said.\n\"We definitely put effort into it, for sure. We want to look nice.\n\"It's about doing whatever you need to feel confident on the start line - and I just think it makes you race better if you're feeling good about yourself.\n\"So much of that comes from the training and the lead up, of course. But it's that extra one or two per cent that makes you stand on the start line and feel like you can do anything, feel like you're a winner.\"\nIn terms of eye-catching track looks, Hodgkinson dominated the final race of her 2026 season by winning the 800m at Athlos in London last month as she debuted a new full-length, hooded speed suit.\nHodgkinson's outfit reminded people of Australian Cathy Freeman's which she won the women's 400m in at the 2000 Sydney Olympics, and it could be a feature for athletes at the next Olympics in Los Angeles in 2028.\nHunter Bell didn't rule out being one of them to don the suit.\n\"The first time you see it, it's like, 'Whoa! Haven't seen that before',\" she said. \"It will be interesting to see whether it becomes the norm.\n\"They do say it's quicker, so I'm definitely not ruling it out.\"\nAround Sky\nUpgrade to get all of Sky Sports, including 1500 live football matches this season\nNot got Sky? Get instant access to Sky Sports with no contract", "fetched_at": "2026-10-09T01:24:15.123300", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Georgia", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.525, "sm": 100, "em": 525, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Hunter", "s": 0.537, "e": 0.863, "sm": 537, "em": 862, "cs": 8, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Bell", "s": 0.875, "e": 1.125, "sm": 875, "em": 1125, "cs": 15, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "had", "s": 1.137, "e": 1.3, "sm": 1137, "em": 1300, "cs": 20, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "a", "s": 1.312, "e": 1.375, "sm": 1312, "em": 1375, "cs": 24, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "great", "s": 1.387, "e": 1.663, "sm": 1387, "em": 1662, "cs": 26, "ce": 31, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "year", "s": 1.675, "e": 2.075, "sm": 1675, "em": 2075, "cs": 32, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ".", "s": 2.075, "e": 2.938, "sm": 2075, "em": 2937, "cs": 36, "ce": 37, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "She", "s": 2.938, "e": 3.175, "sm": 2937, "em": 3175, "cs": 38, "ce": 41, "si": 1}, {"i": 9, "w": "won", "s": 3.188, "e": 3.413, "sm": 3187, "em": 3412, "cs": 42, "ce": 45, "si": 1}, {"i": 10, "w": "three", "s": 3.425, "e": 3.688, "sm": 3425, "em": 3687, "cs": 46, "ce": 51, "si": 1}, {"i": 11, "w": "gold", "s": 3.7, "e": 3.96